{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 13,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        105.94963836669922,
        336.9972839355469,
        147.5496368408203
      ],
      "text": "Executive summary",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.91859436035156,
        527.4454345703125,
        195.36158752441406
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculosis (TB) is a leading cause of death from a single infectious agent, despite being largely",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.1186065673828,
        527.3748779296875,
        208.5615997314453
      ],
      "text": "curable and preventable. In 2019 an estimated 2.9 million of the 10 million people who fell ill with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.31861877441406,
        527.4288940429688,
        221.76161193847656
      ],
      "text": "were not diagnosed or reported to the World Health Organization (WHO). The Political Declaration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.5186309814453,
        527.4256591796875,
        234.9616241455078
      ],
      "text": "adopted by the United Nations General Assembly in September 2018 at the High-Level Meeting on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.71864318847656,
        527.38818359375,
        248.16163635253906
      ],
      "text": "the Fight Against Tuberculosis commits to, among other goals, diagnosing and treating 40 million",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.91859436035156,
        527.4367065429688,
        261.3616027832031
      ],
      "text": "people with TB by 2022. In order to achieve this ambitious target, there is an urgent need to deploy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.11859130859375,
        527.6207275390625,
        274.5616149902344
      ],
      "text": "strategies to improve the diagnosis and initiation of care for people with TB. One of these strategies is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984739303588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.318603515625,
        527.4445190429688,
        287.7616271972656
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for TB disease, which is included in the End TB Strategy as a central component",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        286.51861572265625,
        361.37408447265625,
        300.9616394042969
      ],
      "text": "of its first pillar aimed at ensuring early diagnosis for all with TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.2225341796875,
        527.421142578125,
        322.6655578613281
      ],
      "text": "To facilitate the implementation of TB screening at the country level, WHO published guidelines on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.6285400390625,
        527.3927612304688,
        335.86553955078125
      ],
      "text": "Systematic screening for active tuberculosis: principles and recommendations  in 2013. Since then,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.62261962890625,
        527.4332885742188,
        349.0656433105469
      ],
      "text": "there have been important new studies evaluating the impact of screening interventions on both",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        347.822509765625,
        527.1692504882812,
        362.2655334472656
      ],
      "text": "individual-level and community-level outcomes related to TB, as well as new research evaluating",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.0224914550781,
        527.600830078125,
        375.46551513671875
      ],
      "text": "innovative tools for screening for TB – including the use of computer-aided detection of TB on digital",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997249603271484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.2225036621094,
        527.4442138671875,
        388.66552734375
      ],
      "text": "radiographs, C-reactive protein and molecular WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic tests for TB –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.4225158691406,
        331.4920959472656,
        401.86553955078125
      ],
      "text": "among important populations at high risk for TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.1264953613281,
        527.5706176757812,
        423.56951904296875
      ],
      "text": "In view of these new developments and due to requests by countries for more guidance, WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.3265075683594,
        527.445556640625,
        436.76953125
      ],
      "text": "convened a Guideline Development Group (GDG) in 2020 to examine the evidence and update the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.5265197753906,
        527.4265747070312,
        449.96954345703125
      ],
      "text": "2013 guidelines. The GDG met in virtual sessions between June and October 2020 and proposed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.72650146484375,
        527.4419555664062,
        463.1695251464844
      ],
      "text": "several new and updated recommendations related to TB screening. WHO gratefully acknowledges",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.926513671875,
        527.2052612304688,
        476.3695373535156
      ],
      "text": "the work of the GDG members, the evidence reviewers, representatives of national TB and HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.1264953613281,
        527.4102783203125,
        489.56951904296875
      ],
      "text": "programmes, WHO colleagues, technical and funding partners, civil society representatives, patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.3265075683594,
        437.2622985839844,
        502.76953125
      ],
      "text": "and all others who contributed to the data used to inform this guideline update.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.0303955078125,
        527.3904418945312,
        524.473388671875
      ],
      "text": "The evidence reviewed to address the guideline questions was derived from several trials and other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.2304077148438,
        527.2277221679688,
        537.6734008789062
      ],
      "text": "studies, programmatic data, surveys and modelling work. The certainty of the evidence and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        536.430419921875,
        527.4222412109375,
        550.8734130859375
      ],
      "text": "strength of the recommendations were assessed using the GRADE (Grading of Recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.63037109375,
        527.22607421875,
        564.0733642578125
      ],
      "text": "Assessment, Development and Evaluation) method. Decisions about the strength of a recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.8304443359375,
        527.3695068359375,
        577.2734375
      ],
      "text": "and the evidence depend on the level of confidence in the estimates, as well as on other critical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.0303955078125,
        481.15740966796875,
        590.473388671875
      ],
      "text": "considerations, such as acceptability, feasibility, resource use and impact on health equity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.4703369140625,
        527.4195556640625,
        612.1773071289062
      ],
      "text": "chest radiography The use of   (chest X-ray, or CXR) as a screening tool for detecting TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.9343872070312,
        527.4410400390625,
        625.3773803710938
      ],
      "text": "in several populations was reviewed, including in the general public, people living with HIV, people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.13427734375,
        527.6600341796875,
        638.5772705078125
      ],
      "text": "younger than 15 years who are contacts of TB patients and other high-risk groups. Across all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.3342895507812,
        527.4421997070312,
        651.7772827148438
      ],
      "text": "populations considered, CXR was found to be a sensitive screening tool that, while lacking sufficient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.534423828125,
        527.453125,
        664.9774169921875
      ],
      "text": "specificity to confirm a TB diagnosis, has an important role in the early detection of TB in children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.734375,
        527.4519653320312,
        678.1773681640625
      ],
      "text": "and adults who are at higher risk of TB, as well as the potential to reduce the population burden of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.9343872070312,
        292.769775390625,
        691.3773803710938
      ],
      "text": "TB disease when combined with early treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.3743286132812,
        527.3992309570312,
        713.081298828125
      ],
      "text": "computer-aided detection In recent years   (CAD) software packages have been developed and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        711.8383178710938,
        527.5706787109375,
        726.2813110351562
      ],
      "text": "introduced to automate the interpretation of digital CXR images and produce a numerical score",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        725.038330078125,
        527.544677734375,
        739.4813232421875
      ],
      "text": "indicating the likelihood of TB. Three independent evaluations of CAD were reviewed to develop",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        738.23828125,
        527.2088623046875,
        752.6812744140625
      ],
      "text": "recommendations for both screening and triage for TB. The diagnostic accuracy and the overall",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        751.4382934570312,
        527.4486083984375,
        765.8812866210938
      ],
      "text": "performance of CAD software were similar to the interpretation of digital CXR by a human reader, in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        460.0578918457031,
        801.0170288085938,
        551.980712890625,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Executive summary 1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}